  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyIntroduction": "G4A4 store, while respecting users' privacy, is committed to protecting your personal information. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Title": "1. Collected Information",
  "privacyPolicySection1Content": "To provide better services, we may request the following information:\n\n• Mobile phone number\n• Email address\n• First and last name\n• Postal address (for order delivery)\n• National ID (for issuing official invoices)\n\nThis information is used for processing orders, shipping products, and communicating with you.",
  "privacyPolicySection2Title": "2. How We Use Information",
  "privacyPolicySection2Content": "Your information is used only for the following purposes:\n\n• Processing and shipping orders\n• Sending order-related information and updates\n• Responding to requests and questions\n• Improving service quality\n• Issuing official invoices in accordance with e-commerce laws",
  "privacyPolicySection3Title": "3. Official Contact Information",
  "privacyPolicySection3Content": "The email addresses and phone numbers you register in your profile are considered your official and approved addresses. All communications and responses from the store will be conducted through this information.\n\nIf the information is not entered accurately, the store may request additional information to verify the order.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Title": "4. Information Protection",
  "privacyPolicySection4Content": "We use the highest security standards to protect your information:\n\n• All authentication information is stored encrypted\n• Use of SSL/TLS security protocols\n• Limiting access to personal information\n• Continuous monitoring of security systems\n• Preventing unauthorized access",
  "privacyPolicySection5Title": "5. Sharing Information",
  "privacyPolicySection5Content": "G4A4 store considers users' identity and personal information confidential and does not transfer it to any third party or organization, except in the following cases:\n\n• Legal requirements and provision to judicial authorities\n• Delivery partners (only necessary information for shipping)\n• Valid payment gateways (to complete transactions)",
  "privacyPolicySection6Title": "6. Cookies and IP",
  "privacyPolicySection6Content": "Like other websites, we use cookies and IP collection to:\n\n• Provide a better user experience\n• Improve site performance\n• Analyze visit statistics\n\nYou can manage cookies through your browser settings.",
  "privacyPolicySection7Title": "7. User Comments and Content",
  "privacyPolicySection7Content": "The store may edit users' comments and messages to comply with website rules. If the submitted content falls under criminal content, the store may use the registered information for legal pursuit.",
  "privacyPolicySection8Title": "8. User Responsibilities",
  "privacyPolicySection8Content": "Keeping and maintaining your password is your responsibility. To prevent any potential misuse:\n\n• Keep your password confidential\n• Do not disclose it to others\n• Use strong passwords\n• Change your password immediately if your account is suspicious",
  "privacyPolicySection9Title": "9. Changes to Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicySection9Content": "G4A4 store reserves the right to update this policy if necessary. Changes will be announced through the website.",
  "privacyPolicySection10Title": "10. Contact Us",
  "privacyPolicySection10Content": "If you have any questions, ambiguities, or concerns about your privacy, please contact our support team. We are always ready to respond to you.",
  "privacyPolicyCommitmentTitle": "✓ Our Commitment",
  "privacyPolicyCommitmentContent": "G4A4 store uses all its capabilities to protect and maintain users' information and personal privacy and hopes to provide a safe, comfortable, and pleasant shopping experience for all users.",
